{"id":"msg_m_ex_julia_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_julia","label":"Julia · Nikke"},"label":"2. Conductor,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_julia_01","next":"msg_m_ex_julia_03","speakers":{"julia":"Julia"},"icons":{"julia":"si_c150_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_1","text":"Conductor,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_2","text":"good... morning?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_3","text":"Why the question mark?","jump":"m_ex_julia_02_5"},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_4","text":"Morning?","jump":"m_ex_julia_02_7"},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_5","text":"I'm sorry,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_6","text":"I wasn't sure if it was morning.","jump":"m_ex_julia_02_10"},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_7","text":"Oh no,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_8","text":"is it not morning?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_9","text":"I'm sorry,","jump":"m_ex_julia_02_10"},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_10","text":"I went straight to practice for a while after returning from a trip.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_11","text":"Before I knew it, I'd let myself get carried away by the music","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_12","text":"and lost track of time!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_13","text":"So you've been practicing instead of sleeping?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_14","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_15","text":"It's only because","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_16","text":"I couldn't bring myself to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_17","text":"disrupt the musical flow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_18","text":"Hurry up and get some sleep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_19","text":"I can't do that!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_20","text":"It's been a long while since","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_21","text":"I've been somewhere so comfy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_22","text":"It's enough to inspire one to write a symphony,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_23","text":"so I can't let such inspiration pass me by.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_24","text":"Come, tell me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_25","text":"what would you like to hear?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_26","text":"If I start my day on a happy note,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_27","text":"I'm positive I can make it last for a long time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_28","text":"I'll tell you once you wake up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_29","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_30","text":"But the moment may have passed by then...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_31","text":"Then I'll let you know while you're dreaming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_32","text":"But how?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_33","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_34","text":"Just because you want to share the same dream with someone","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_35","text":"doesn't mean you can dream it into existence.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_36","text":"Unless... someone developed a device like that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_37","text":"while I was up on the surface?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_38","text":"I'm afraid not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_39","text":"Oh, just as I thought.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_40","text":"Either way, I'm heading to bed, and I suggest you do the same.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_41","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_42","text":"Is that okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_43","text":"Absolutely not!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_44","text":"Actually...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_45","text":"I never considered playing music while dreaming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_46","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_47","text":"My teachers always told me true artists","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_48","text":"should never be deceived by emotional appeals.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_49","text":"However, since it's you...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_50","text":"perhaps this truly can forge a new form of musical expression.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_51","text":"Very well then, I will see you in my dreams.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_julia_02_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_julia_02_52","text":"Sweet dreams.","jump":null}],"chat":true}